"EMAIL_HOST, EMAIL_PORT, EMAIL_HOST_USER, EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD и "
"DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL в deploy/.env.prod и перезапустите сервер"
msgstr ""
"Email sending is not configured: invitations and password reset links go "
"nowhere, they are written to the server log. New users will not be able to "
"sign in. Set EMAIL_HOST, EMAIL_PORT, EMAIL_HOST_USER, EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD and"
" DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL in deploy/.env.prod and restart the server"

